**`SpringApplicationShutdownHook.java`** — 2 changes:

1. **`deregisterFailedApplicationContext` — drop redundant `SpringApplicationShutdownHook.this.` qualifier** (line 100)  
   The method is defined directly on the outer class, so `SpringApplicationShutdownHook.this.contexts` is identical to `this.contexts`. The qualifier is only needed when accessing the enclosing instance from *inside* an inner class (which is the case at lines 203–204 in `Handlers` and lines 253–254 in `ApplicationContextClosedListener` — those are left unchanged).

